 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Service Quotas API (2019-06-24). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Discover the B2B Data Interchange Profiles quota (b2bi/L-05F6A9EF) in us-east-1, us-west-2 and eu-west-1. Its AWS default is five. Applied reads use the total capacity enforced by CreateProfile, including slots already occupied. The three discovery lists return at most one item. ListServiceQuotas supports an exact QuotaCode and ACCOUNT, RESOURCE or ALL. Only account-level capacity is configured. Resource contexts and usage metrics are unsupported. Adjustable describes the AWS quota. An increase request is stored against current account capacity. SupportCaseAllowed=false records NOT_APPROVED. Omitted or true records PENDING locally, with at most one outstanding request per quota and Region. No support case is opened and the local profile limit is unchanged.",
  "title": "Service Quotas (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2019-06-24"
 },
